---
// src/pages/terms.astro
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Red Surge Fitness"
  description="Terms and conditions for using the Red Surge Fitness website and purchasing our products."
>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tighter mb-4 uppercase">
      Terms of <span class="text-red-500">Service</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 mb-12">
      Last updated: {
        new Date().toLocaleDateString("en-US", {
          month: "long",
          day: "numeric",
          year: "numeric",
        })
      }
    </p>

    <div
      class="prose prose-invert prose-lg prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:tracking-tight prose-a:text-red-400 hover:prose-a:text-red-300 prose-p:text-gray-300"
    >
      <h2>1. Overview</h2>
      <p>
        This website is operated by Red Surge Fitness. Throughout the site, the
        terms "we", "us" and "our" refer to Red Surge Fitness. By visiting our
        site and/or purchasing something from us, you engage in our "Service"
        and agree to be bound by the following terms and conditions.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Online Store Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By agreeing to these Terms of Service, you represent that you are at
        least the age of majority in your state or province of residence. You
        may not use our products for any illegal or unauthorized purpose nor may
        you, in the use of the Service, violate any laws in your jurisdiction.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Products and Pricing</h2>
      <p>
        Prices for our products are subject to change without notice. We reserve
        the right at any time to modify or discontinue the Service (or any part
        or content thereof) without notice at any time. We have made every
        effort to display as accurately as possible the colors and images of our
        products that appear at the store.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Accuracy of Billing and Account Information</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to refuse any order you place with us. We may, in
        our sole discretion, limit or cancel quantities purchased per person,
        per household or per order. You agree to provide current, complete and
        accurate purchase and account information for all purchases made at our
        store.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms of Service and any separate agreements whereby we provide
        you Services shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the
        laws of the State of [Insert State], United States.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about the Terms of Service should be sent to us at <a
          href="mailto:support@redsurgefitness.com"
          >support@redsurgefitness.com</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
